endar (RFC 5545) specification.\",\n          \"default\": \"Does not repeat\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"start_date\",\n        \"start_time\",\n        \"duration\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"save_draft\",\n    \"description\": \"Save an email as a draft in the user's mailbox without sending it; recipients may be left empty.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"subject\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Subject line of the draft, copied exactly as the user gives it.\"\n        },\n        \"body\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Plain-text body of the draft, copied exactly as the user gives it.\"\n        },\n        \"to\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"description\": \"Recipient email addresses, in any order.\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Email address\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"subject\",\n        \"body\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"search_products\",\n    \"description\": \"Search for products based on various criteria such as color, size, category, price range, and brand, to find specific Stock Keeping Units (SKUs) or general Stock Production Units (SPUs).\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"color\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The color of the product. This is an optional parameter that can be used to refine SKU searches.\"\n        },\n        \"size\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The size of the product. This is an optional parameter that can be used to refine SKU searches.\"\n        },\n        \"category\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The category of the product, such as 'electronics', 'clothing', 'shoes' or 'furniture'. This parameter is required for both SPU and SKU level searches.\"\n        },\n        \"price_min\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"description\": \"The minimum price of the product search. Enter a float value representing the lowest price in dollars.\",\n          \"default\": 0\n        },\n        \"price_max\": {\n          \"type\": \"number\",\n          \"description\": \"The maximum price of the product search. Enter a float value representing the highest price in dollars.\"\n        },\n        \"brand\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The brand of the product. This is an optional parameter for searching within a specific brand.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"category\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: Find the users named Okafor.\n\nReply with only a JSON array of the tool calls that fulfil the request, each of the form {\"name\": \"<tool name>\", \"arguments\": {...}}, where \"arguments\" is a JSON object (not a string). When the request needs several calls, list them all. Reply with [] if no tool fits the request, or if the request does not give a value for a required argument: never guess one. Include every required argument. Include an optional argument only if the request asks for a value for it; otherwise leave it out and the tool applies its default. Give each value the type its schema declares: JSON numbers for integer and number, true or false for boolean, and strings for string, copied exactly as written.","role":"user"},{"content":"[{\"name\":\"searchUsers\",\"arguments\":{\"query\":\"Okafor\"}}]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Tool results:\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"searchUsers\",\n    \"result\": [\n      {\n        \"userId\": 32434,\n        \"name\": \"Dev Okafor\",\n        \"email\": \"dev.okafor@example.com\",\n        \"role\": \"viewer\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"userId\": 13127,\n        \"name\": \"Ben Okafor\",\n    